<article class="env-lemma" id="06QF">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06QF">Lemma <span data-tag="06QF">101.28.5</span>.</a> Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ \mathcal{X}' \ar[r] \ar[d] &  \mathcal{X} \ar[d] \\  \mathcal{Y}' \ar[r] &  \mathcal{Y} }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a fibre product of algebraic stacks. If $\mathcal{Y}' \to \mathcal{Y}$ is surjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation and $\mathcal{X}'$ is a gerbe over $\mathcal{Y}'$, then $\mathcal{X}$ is a gerbe over $\mathcal{Y}$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows immediately from Lemma <a href="/tag/06QA" data-tag="06QA">101.27.13</a> and Stacks, Lemma <a href="/tag/06P4" data-tag="06P4">8.11.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>